WEBVTT

00:01:29.007 --> 00:01:32.417
SRK: OK. Thank you for being here
and on this Probot.

00:01:32.417 --> 00:01:34.217
Before I start, I just want to know,

00:01:34.217 --> 00:01:36.347
would you tell us more 
about this technology

00:01:36.347 --> 00:01:40.737
via which we are able to see you
so clearly and without any delay,

00:01:40.737 --> 00:01:42.917
just so that the audience
gets to understand it.

00:01:43.747 --> 00:01:47.415
Well, this is great. It's called Beam.

00:01:47.415 --> 00:01:51.415
It allows me to use the robot
to move around and see all of you.

00:01:51.975 --> 00:01:54.775
As you can see,
technology keeps getting better

00:01:54.775 --> 00:01:57.585
and hopefully over time
we can make it easy,

00:01:57.585 --> 00:02:00.375
so that it doesn't matter 
where you physically are,